id: brim/detect
name: the four-number answer on the materials
prose: brim detect on a picture prints four numbers — top, bottom, left, right — the even margin found from each edge. On the framed material all four sides answer 4, on the clear material all four answer 0, and a mid-range sensitivity keeps the framed answer.
scope:
- src/**
- Makefile
- materials/bordered.jpg
- materials/clear.jpg
covers:
- R1
- R4
rows:
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect materials/clear.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      0 0 0 0
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --threshold 0.3
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --threshold 0.7
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
